__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
*.s
*.o
*.ll
# 模型默认不入库（体积）。确需入库的小文件用 `git add -f` 显式例外，例如
# models/graph/cnn.onnx 和 models/graph/qwen3-0.6b-onnx/ 下的清单；
# 那批权重本身（2.41GB）走 Release 资产，见 qwen3-0.6b-onnx/获取与校验.md。
models/
venv/
.venv/
.claude/
.omo/
scratchv.egg-info/
benchmark_reports/*
!benchmark_reports/topic17_fix_review.md

# Course site — generated by `make docs`, never commit
docs/topics/html/

# Build artifacts at root (generated, never commit)
/output.bin
/output.ll
/output.s
/output_llvm.ll
/output_rv64fd.s
/output_rv64im.s
/output_spike.elf
/output_spike_min.elf
/spike_stderr.txt
/spike_stdout.txt
/output/

# Presentation files
/ScratchV_宣讲PPT*.pptx

# Caches
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
# CFG visualization artifacts (generated, never commit)
*.dot
*.png
.idea/

# W1 probe outputs — regenerated by probes/w1_tiny_transformer/run.py.
# Everything here is disposable *except* the model, which is committed through
# Git LFS (see .gitattributes) so downstream work can fetch the artifact
# without re-running the probe. Note the trailing `/*`: excluding the directory
# itself would make the negation below impossible.
probes/w1_tiny_transformer/out/*
!probes/w1_tiny_transformer/out/tiny_transformer_2l.onnx
